                        <div xml:id="m-539eb851-ac16-4109-888d-17fa52748226">
                            <lg xml:id="m-da4edd0e-66cf-4274-9625-915ac7d124d4">
                                <l xml:id="m-4848e0e3-f9d9-47f1-92a5-36b76a7f1ef1" facs="#m-9e51e3dc-29a4-4685-bb03-ab9cdccf547d" label="text-like">Saturdays after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-e60edd3f-6c48-43ef-8b43-fa80e1ab6331" facs="#m-a0fa6b11-b590-43ab-bfab-04b648bbf232" label="ambiguous">994</l><l xml:id="m-be1f40a6-751e-4f04-ae6d-4a8ae79db858" facs="#m-89a855d5-0c03-4597-8ab1-2244b6d6a6cd" label="lyrics-like">in di-ébus nóstris. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-5f02593d-d28c-4832-8174-62466b617050" facs="#m-9e7bca67-4ce7-43fa-a40c-cecc4418689f" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212.</l><l xml:id="m-7ab2730b-f97e-4626-bf8d-560f01a681bc" facs="#m-2c1756b9-08ab-47ce-969f-e511bdc3c4bb" label="text-like">Saturday before the 2nd Sunday of October.</l><l xml:id="m-b1f0d1cc-7c7b-49bc-9d59-b1d05b605a09" facs="#m-1718cee1-c131-442e-b78f-e03dc84f58ef" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-594645d6-9195-4dca-ab9b-62e516a16161" facs="#m-3aaa04e6-96ad-47a4-b1b2-4628008d721b" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-992623ac-13bd-4648-9f68-46fdb4786353" facs="#m-e46ab3f3-5b2f-4c2a-ac26-d00b1df2a105" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-4bfaa6e2-2ab6-490d-8e60-266ab7da0ced" facs="#m-191f2c63-3fe2-482f-8c54-f1ce8f07ee4c" label="lyrics-like">E-fúlsit sol “in clype-os áure-os, et resplen¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf1bfc8a-84a2-480c-96eb-47bef6e94036" facs="#m-26898647-06e3-409b-8ef6-8d5d55cdea42" label="lyrics-like">du-é-runt móntes ab é-is, et forti-túdo génti- um dis¬</l><l xml:id="m-afe20cdb-9591-4b63-a4f0-94e97009d9b8" facs="#m-615f5ecb-40e4-40cd-a7a8-db069b1e68dd" label="lyrics-like">sipá-ta est. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3fc0c40a-82da-4a69-bd5b-5e84e353edc1" facs="#m-2490922c-8525-41eb-a9e0-c173fe7b55cd" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212.</l><l xml:id="m-d65bc5a1-ca13-46e8-8259-807a312e42ca" facs="#m-f9b39f0e-dd43-4007-8b3f-300be2ee325a" label="text-like">Saturday before the 3rd Sunday of October.</l><l xml:id="m-3f8d8e04-892f-4511-81d6